  m_Name: Carta_TelhadosVerdes
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Telhados Verdes
  _titleEn: Green Roofs
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Telhados com vegeta\xE7\xE3o isolam o calor, reduzem o gasto com ar-condicionado
    e seguram parte da \xE1gua da chuva."
  _summaryEn: Vegetated roofs insulate against heat, cut air conditioning costs and
    hold back part of the rainwater.
  _realWorld: "Nova York d\xE1 desconto no imposto predial desde 2009 a quem cobre
    ao menos metade do telhado com vegeta\xE7\xE3o."
  _realWorldEn: Since 2009 New York has offered a property tax credit to owners who
    cover at least half of their roof with plants.
  _tradeOffs: "O telhado precisa aguentar o peso extra, e a instala\xE7\xE3o e a
    manuten\xE7\xE3o custam mais que um telhado comum."
  _tradeOffsEn: The roof must bear the extra weight, and installation and upkeep
    cost more than a regular roof.
  _sources:
  - Label: Green roof (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Green_roof
